  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 8005.03 Change of Address",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 8005.03 Change of Address.\n\n(a) All license holders shall notify the department in writing of any change of address within 30 days of such change.\n\n(b) Written notification shall be sent to the following address:\n\nNH State Fire Marshal’s Office\n\nDivision of Fire Safety\n\n33 Hazen Drive\n\nConcord, NH 03305\n\nSource. #8954, eff 7-21-07",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c8000.html"
